---
---

<div class="author-card">
  <style>
    .author-card {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start;
      background: var(--color-author-card-bg);
      padding: 24px; border-radius: var(--color-radius-card);
      gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px var(--color-shadow);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .author-avatar {
      width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0066cc, #2563eb);
      color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center;
      justify-content: center; font-size: 28px; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .author-name { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: var(--color-text); }
    .author-bio { margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
  </style>
  <div class="author-avatar">👤</div>
  <div>
    <p class="author-name">本文作者：栋木遇楠枫</p>
    <p class="author-bio">原创技术文章，转载请注明原文链接，欢迎评论区交流技术问题。</p>
  </div>
</div>
